@startuml
[*] --> IdleState
IdleState --> AccessingTimeTracking : User initiates time tracking
AccessingTimeTracking --> TrackingTime : Start tracking
TrackingTime --> AccessingTimeTracking : Stop tracking
AccessingTimeTracking --> DisplayingTimeInformation : View time info
AccessingTimeTracking --> ViewingStatistics : View statistics
AccessingTimeTracking --> SearchingTasks : Search tasks
SearchingTasks --> ViewingTaskDetails : View task details
ViewingTaskDetails --> AccessingTimeTracking : Return to tracking
DisplayingTimeInformation --> AccessingTimeTracking : Return to tracking
ViewingStatistics --> AccessingTimeTracking : Return to tracking
AccessingTimeTracking --> [*] : Exit
@enduml
